Package: populiva
Title: Client for the 'Populiva' Research Participant API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tyler", "Horan", email = "tyler@populiva.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Digion Inc", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Create, launch and manage online studies on 'Populiva'
    <https://populiva.com>, a research participant platform. Review
    submissions, pay bonuses, manage participant groups and issue signed
    provenance reports from R, and get results back as data frames that join
    to your survey or experiment data by participant ID. Wraps the researcher
    API documented at <https://populiva.com/developers>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://populiva.com/developers, https://github.com/tylerhoran/populiva-r
BugReports: https://github.com/tylerhoran/populiva-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.1.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    jsonlite
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
